WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.038
Here's the route.

2
00:00:01.038 --> 00:00:04.228
The operator runbook asks
for twelve daily checks,

3
00:00:04.228 --> 00:00:09.013
most done one portal at a time, and a
quiet portal looks just like a broken feed.

4
00:00:09.013 --> 00:00:12.224
Scene one turns twelve
checks into twelve tabs.

5
00:00:12.224 --> 00:00:15.575
Scene two catches an export
someone edited in the portal.

6
00:00:15.575 --> 00:00:18.556
Scene three is the morning
of November sixteenth,

7
00:00:18.556 --> 00:00:23.137
when the sign-in logs stopped overnight
and a domain controller went silent.

8
00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:26.912
Scene four is the next morning, and
what the empty queues were hiding.

9
00:00:26.912 --> 00:00:29.963
Scene five tries to file
the picture as evidence.

10
00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:33.050
And scene six deploys
it, the same way twice.
